# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use PEC to mitigate gates noise and combine it with TREX to also mitigate measurement noise when estimating observables' expectation values.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara memakai PEC untuk memitigasi noise gate dan menggabungkannya dengan TREX untuk juga memitigasi noise pengukuran saat mengestimasi expectation value observable.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The workflow follows:\n"
"1. Specify a circuit and observable.\n"
"2. Compute exact expectation values by using Qiskit's statevector simulator.\n"
"3. Compute noisy, unmitigated expectation values.\n"
"4. Learn the entangling layers' noise by using qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Prepare a PEC + TREX program and add a TREX calibration circuit to it.\n"
"6. Compare the mitigated expectation values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alur kerjanya sebagai berikut:\n"
"1. Tentukan circuit dan observable.\n"
"2. Hitung expectation value eksak dengan simulator statevector milik Qiskit.\n"
"3. Hitung expectation value ber-noise tanpa mitigasi.\n"
"4. Pelajari noise layer entangling dengan qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Siapkan program PEC + TREX dan tambahkan circuit kalibrasi TREX ke dalamnya.\n"
"6. Bandingkan expectation value hasil mitigasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a circuit and observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Tentukan circuit dan observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a mirror circuit of a Trotterized time evolution of a linear transverse-field Ising model on eight qubits. Mirror the circuit to cancel the circuit unitary and form an identity circuit. This lets you easily compute each observable's ideal expectation value. In addition, mirroring doubles the circuit depth, which in turn doubles the noise's effect.\n"
msgstr "Siapkan circuit cermin dari evolusi waktu Trotterized sebuah model Ising medan-transversal linear pada delapan qubit. Cerminkan circuit untuk meniadakan unitary circuit dan membentuk circuit identitas. Ini memudahkan kamu menghitung expectation value ideal setiap observable. Selain itu, pencerminan menggandakan kedalaman circuit, yang pada gilirannya menggandakan efek noise.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the angle $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{2}$ to keep all the gates in the circuit from the Clifford group, allowing faster simulation by using the `stabilizer` simulator.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan sudut $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{2}$ agar semua gate dalam circuit berasal dari grup Clifford, sehingga simulasi lebih cepat dengan memakai simulator `stabilizer`.\n"

