# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a combined PEC and TREX program {#prepare-a-combined-pec-and-trex-program}"
msgstr "Siapkan program gabungan PEC dan TREX {#prepare-a-combined-pec-and-trex-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we prepare both a `TREX` and a `PEC` task, and add the `TREX` task as a variable to the `PEC` task. This ensures that all the required properties needed for TREX mitigation are added to the PEC mitigated item (like measurement twirling). The injected noise is sampled once per randomization, so the statistical error of PEC is controlled by the number of randomizations rather than the shots per randomization. Thus, many randomizations are used - each with few shots - keeping the total number of shots the same as for the unmitigated program.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita menyiapkan task `TREX` sekaligus `PEC`, dan menambahkan task `TREX` sebagai variabel ke task `PEC`. Ini memastikan semua properti yang diperlukan untuk mitigasi TREX ditambahkan ke item yang dimitigasi PEC (seperti measurement twirling). Noise yang disuntikkan disampel sekali per randomization, sehingga error statistik PEC dikendalikan oleh jumlah randomization, bukan shot per randomization. Jadi, banyak randomization dipakai - masing-masing dengan sedikit shot - sambil menjaga total shot tetap sama dengan program tanpa mitigasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The TREX calibration circuit is added to the program in order to learn the readout noise while executing the program. The TREX calibration circuit is very shallow, which makes additional randomizations for it to be relatively cheap and allows the readout noise to be learned more accurately.\n"
msgstr "Circuit kalibrasi TREX ditambahkan ke program untuk mempelajari noise readout selagi program dijalankan. Circuit kalibrasi TREX sangat dangkal, sehingga randomization tambahan untuknya relatif murah dan memungkinkan noise readout dipelajari dengan lebih akurat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examine shot overhead, execute the program, and post-process {#examine-shot-overhead-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"
msgstr "Periksa shot overhead, jalankan program, lalu lakukan post-processing {#examine-shot-overhead-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "PEC returns an unbiased expectation value estimation, with a cost of large shot overhead. The required shot overhead can be approximated by calculating the circuit gamma factor, which reflects the effect of the learned noise model on the circuit. By default, the number of randomization of the PEC task is scaled by the approximate amount of shot overhead required to have an unbiased estimation (~$\\gamma^2$). To avoid this automatic scale, you can set the parameter `scale_randomizations_by_gamma` to `False`. The shots overhead is capped by the `max_sampling_overhead` parameter.\n"
msgstr "PEC menghasilkan estimasi expectation value yang tidak bias, dengan biaya shot overhead yang besar. Shot overhead yang dibutuhkan dapat diperkirakan dengan menghitung faktor gamma circuit, yang mencerminkan efek model noise yang dipelajari pada circuit. Secara default, jumlah randomization pada task PEC diskalakan menurut perkiraan shot overhead yang diperlukan untuk estimasi tanpa bias (~$\\gamma^2$). Untuk menghindari penskalaan otomatis ini, kamu bisa menyetel parameter `scale_randomizations_by_gamma` ke `False`. Shot overhead dibatasi oleh parameter `max_sampling_overhead`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You should review the number of shots required by PEC to reach unbiased estimation before execution to decide whether this amount is affordable, as this scales exponentially in the noise rates and circuit depth.\n"
msgstr "Kamu sebaiknya meninjau jumlah shot yang dibutuhkan PEC untuk mencapai estimasi tanpa bias sebelum eksekusi untuk memutuskan apakah jumlah itu terjangkau, karena jumlah ini naik secara eksponensial terhadap laju noise dan kedalaman circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the mitigated expectation values {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values}"
msgstr "Bandingkan expectation value hasil mitigasi {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, plot the expectation value of each observable. PEC + TREX recovers the exact expectation values within its error bars, while the unmitigated result is biased well below it.\n"
msgstr "Terakhir, plot expectation value dari setiap observable. PEC + TREX memulihkan expectation value eksak dalam batas error bar-nya, sementara hasil tanpa mitigasi bias jauh di bawahnya.\n"

